# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Transpiler"
msgstr "Transpiler"

# doq: kept in English by the translator (name or code)
#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Transpiler {#transpiler}"
msgstr "Transpiler {#transpiler}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The [`generate_boxing_pass_manager()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/samplomatic/auto/transpiler-generate-boxing-pass-manager#samplomatic.transpiler.generate_boxing_pass_manager \"samplomatic.transpiler.generate_boxing_pass_manager\") function is a flexible and convenient tool to build a [`qiskit.transpiler.PassManager`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.PassManager) that can group the circuit instructions into annotated boxes. This gives an easy alternative to manually grouping and annotating circuits, and is useful for automating a workflow, testing different circuit boxing strategies, and so on.\n"
msgstr "Fungsi [`generate_boxing_pass_manager()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/samplomatic/auto/transpiler-generate-boxing-pass-manager#samplomatic.transpiler.generate_boxing_pass_manager \"samplomatic.transpiler.generate_boxing_pass_manager\") ialah alat yang fleksibel dan mudah untuk membina [`qiskit.transpiler.PassManager`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.PassManager) yang boleh mengumpulkan arahan litar ke dalam box beranotasi. Ini memberikan alternatif yang mudah kepada pengumpulan dan penganotasian litar secara manual, dan berguna untuk mengautomasikan aliran kerja, menguji strategi box litar yang berbeza, dan sebagainya.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This guide illustrates how to use [`generate_boxing_pass_manager()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/samplomatic/auto/transpiler-generate-boxing-pass-manager#samplomatic.transpiler.generate_boxing_pass_manager \"samplomatic.transpiler.generate_boxing_pass_manager\") and its arguments. To highlight the effects of each of the function’s arguments, the following sections mainly refer to the circuit below.\n"
msgstr "Panduan ini menunjukkan cara menggunakan [`generate_boxing_pass_manager()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/samplomatic/auto/transpiler-generate-boxing-pass-manager#samplomatic.transpiler.generate_boxing_pass_manager \"samplomatic.transpiler.generate_boxing_pass_manager\") dan argumennya. Untuk menonjolkan kesan setiap argumen fungsi, bahagian berikut terutamanya merujuk kepada litar di bawah.\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "![../\\_images/cf27e1ef03e51b2360c90165a4efeaa793da36083bb674774ca06c8181ef63dd.png](/docs/images/addons/samplomatic/cf27e1ef03e51b2360c90165a4efeaa793da36083bb674774ca06c8181ef63dd.avif)\n"
