# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This pattern also combines naturally with the barrier-based ISA boxing workflow. The boxing pass manager runs as a post-scheduling step, after barriers from the original logical circuit have survived transpilation, so they guide stratification as expected.\n"
msgstr "Corak ini juga sesuai digabungkan dengan aliran kerja pengotakan ISA berasaskan barrier. Boxing pass manager dijalankan sebagai langkah selepas penjadualan, setelah barrier daripada litar logik asal kekal selepas transpilasi, jadi ia memandu stratifikasi seperti yang dijangkakan.\n"

