# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Inspect and modify annotations {#inspect-and-modify-annotations}"
msgstr "Periksa dan ubah suai anotasi {#inspect-and-modify-annotations}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "After auto-boxing, you might want to inspect the annotations on specific boxes or adjust them. For example, to add noise injection, remove annotations, or change a twirling group. Samplomatic provides a set of utility functions in [`samplomatic.utils`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/samplomatic/utils#module-samplomatic.utils \"samplomatic.utils\") for this purpose. All of them return a **new circuit** without modifying the original.\n"
msgstr "Selepas pengotakan automatik, anda mungkin mahu memeriksa anotasi pada kotak tertentu atau melaraskannya. Contohnya, untuk menambah suntikan hingar, mengalih keluar anotasi, atau menukar kumpulan twirling. Samplomatic menyediakan satu set fungsi utiliti dalam [`samplomatic.utils`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/samplomatic/utils#module-samplomatic.utils \"samplomatic.utils\") untuk tujuan ini. Kesemuanya mengembalikan **litar baharu** tanpa mengubah litar asal.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "[`extend_annotations()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/samplomatic/auto/utils-extend-annotations#samplomatic.utils.extend_annotations \"samplomatic.utils.extend_annotations\") appends one or more annotations to every box in the circuit.\n"
msgstr "[`extend_annotations()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/samplomatic/auto/utils-extend-annotations#samplomatic.utils.extend_annotations \"samplomatic.utils.extend_annotations\") menambah satu atau lebih anotasi pada setiap kotak dalam litar.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "[`filter_annotations()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/samplomatic/auto/utils-filter-annotations#samplomatic.utils.filter_annotations \"samplomatic.utils.filter_annotations\") keeps only annotations of specified types, removing the rest. [`replace_annotations()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/samplomatic/auto/utils-replace-annotations#samplomatic.utils.replace_annotations \"samplomatic.utils.replace_annotations\") applies a callable to each annotation; the callable returns a list of annotations to substitute in its place (return `[]` to remove, a single-element list to replace, or a multi-element list to expand).\n"
msgstr "[`filter_annotations()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/samplomatic/auto/utils-filter-annotations#samplomatic.utils.filter_annotations \"samplomatic.utils.filter_annotations\") hanya mengekalkan anotasi bagi jenis yang ditentukan dan membuang selebihnya. [`replace_annotations()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/samplomatic/auto/utils-replace-annotations#samplomatic.utils.replace_annotations \"samplomatic.utils.replace_annotations\") menggunakan callable pada setiap anotasi; callable itu mengembalikan senarai anotasi sebagai gantian (kembalikan `[]` untuk mengalih keluar, senarai satu elemen untuk menggantikan, atau senarai berbilang elemen untuk mengembangkan).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The general-purpose [`map_annotations()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/samplomatic/auto/utils-map-annotations#samplomatic.utils.map_annotations \"samplomatic.utils.map_annotations\") function accepts any callable that maps a list of annotations to a new list, giving you full control over per-box transformations. [`strip_annotations()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/samplomatic/auto/utils-strip-annotations#samplomatic.utils.strip_annotations \"samplomatic.utils.strip_annotations\") is a convenience wrapper that removes all annotations from every box.\n"
msgstr "Fungsi serba guna [`map_annotations()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/samplomatic/auto/utils-map-annotations#samplomatic.utils.map_annotations \"samplomatic.utils.map_annotations\") menerima sebarang callable yang memetakan senarai anotasi kepada senarai baharu, memberi anda kawalan penuh ke atas transformasi bagi setiap kotak. [`strip_annotations()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/samplomatic/auto/utils-strip-annotations#samplomatic.utils.strip_annotations \"samplomatic.utils.strip_annotations\") ialah pembungkus kemudahan yang mengalih keluar semua anotasi daripada setiap kotak.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "For bulk changes like adding [`InjectNoise`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/samplomatic/auto/inject-noise#samplomatic.InjectNoise \"samplomatic.InjectNoise\") to all gate boxes, the `inject_noise_targets` parameter of [`generate_boxing_pass_manager()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/samplomatic/auto/transpiler-generate-boxing-pass-manager#samplomatic.transpiler.generate_boxing_pass_manager \"samplomatic.transpiler.generate_boxing_pass_manager\") is the most concise option. These utilities are useful for selective per-box edits that the pass manager parameters do not cover.\n"
msgstr "Untuk perubahan secara pukal seperti menambah [`InjectNoise`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/samplomatic/auto/inject-noise#samplomatic.InjectNoise \"samplomatic.InjectNoise\") pada semua kotak gate, parameter `inject_noise_targets` bagi [`generate_boxing_pass_manager()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/samplomatic/auto/transpiler-generate-boxing-pass-manager#samplomatic.transpiler.generate_boxing_pass_manager \"samplomatic.transpiler.generate_boxing_pass_manager\") ialah pilihan yang paling ringkas. Utiliti ini berguna untuk suntingan terpilih bagi setiap kotak yang tidak dilindungi oleh parameter pass manager.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Build a circuit {#build-a-circuit}"
msgstr "Bina litar {#build-a-circuit}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Every pass manager produced by [`generate_boxing_pass_manager()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/samplomatic/auto/transpiler-generate-boxing-pass-manager#samplomatic.transpiler.generate_boxing_pass_manager \"samplomatic.transpiler.generate_boxing_pass_manager\") returns circuits that can be successfully turned into a template/samplex pair by [`build()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/samplomatic/auto/build#samplomatic.build \"samplomatic.build\"). For example, the following code calls the [`build()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/samplomatic/auto/build#samplomatic.build \"samplomatic.build\") function on a circuit produced by a boxing pass manager.\n"
msgstr "Setiap pass manager yang dihasilkan oleh [`generate_boxing_pass_manager()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/samplomatic/auto/transpiler-generate-boxing-pass-manager#samplomatic.transpiler.generate_boxing_pass_manager \"samplomatic.transpiler.generate_boxing_pass_manager\") mengembalikan litar yang boleh diubah dengan berjaya menjadi pasangan templat/samplex oleh [`build()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/samplomatic/auto/build#samplomatic.build \"samplomatic.build\"). Contohnya, kod berikut memanggil fungsi [`build()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/samplomatic/auto/build#samplomatic.build \"samplomatic.build\") pada litar yang dihasilkan oleh boxing pass manager.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "To ensure that any transpiled circuit can be successfully built, the pass managers know how to include additional boxes when they are needed. For example, consider the circuit below, which ends with an unmeasured qubit `0`.\n"
msgstr "Bagi memastikan sebarang litar yang ditranspilasi dapat dibina dengan berjaya, pass manager tahu cara menyertakan kotak tambahan apabila diperlukan. Contohnya, pertimbangkan litar di bawah, yang berakhir dengan qubit `0` yang tidak diukur.\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "![../\\_images/0452779799470d2deb4d32ce19f5aa28dfe8055a064e67c0e8e5684389845b0f.png](/docs/images/addons/samplomatic/0452779799470d2deb4d32ce19f5aa28dfe8055a064e67c0e8e5684389845b0f.avif)\n"
msgstr "![../\\_images/0452779799470d2deb4d32ce19f5aa28dfe8055a064e67c0e8e5684389845b0f.png](/docs/images/addons/samplomatic/0452779799470d2deb4d32ce19f5aa28dfe8055a064e67c0e8e5684389845b0f.avif)\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Drawing left-dressed boxes around the gates and measurements would result in a circuit that has uncollected virtual gates on qubit `0`, and calling [`build()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/samplomatic/auto/build#samplomatic.build \"samplomatic.build\") on this circuit would result in an error. To avoid this, the pass managers returned by [`generate_boxing_pass_manager()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/samplomatic/auto/transpiler-generate-boxing-pass-manager#samplomatic.transpiler.generate_boxing_pass_manager \"samplomatic.transpiler.generate_boxing_pass_manager\") can add right-dressed boxes to act as collectors. For example, in the following code, qubit `0` is terminated by a right-dressed box that picks up the uncollected virtual gate. The single-qubit gates acting on qubit `0` are also placed inside the box in order to minimize the depth of the resulting circuit.\n"
msgstr "Melukis kotak berpakaian-kiri di sekeliling gate dan pengukuran akan menghasilkan litar yang mempunyai gate maya yang tidak dikumpulkan pada qubit `0`, dan memanggil [`build()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/samplomatic/auto/build#samplomatic.build \"samplomatic.build\") pada litar ini akan menyebabkan ralat. Untuk mengelakkannya, pass manager yang dikembalikan oleh [`generate_boxing_pass_manager()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/samplomatic/auto/transpiler-generate-boxing-pass-manager#samplomatic.transpiler.generate_boxing_pass_manager \"samplomatic.transpiler.generate_boxing_pass_manager\") boleh menambah kotak berpakaian-kanan yang bertindak sebagai pengumpul. Contohnya, dalam kod berikut, qubit `0` ditamatkan oleh kotak berpakaian-kanan yang mengutip gate maya yang tidak dikumpulkan. Gate satu-qubit yang bertindak pada qubit `0` juga diletakkan di dalam kotak itu bagi meminimumkan kedalaman litar yang terhasil.\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
